  "summary_localized": {
    "pt": "Servidor personalizado para o videomapping Porto Legends, com 50 saídas de projecção controladas por 1 servidor master, 5 node servers e um portátil de mapeamento, desenvolvido em TouchDesigner.",
    "en": "Custom server for the Porto Legends video mapping, with 50 projection outputs controlled by 1 master server, 5 node servers, and a mapping laptop, all developed in TouchDesigner."
  },
  "body_html": "<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>name: Porto Legends Custom Media Server<br>date: 2019-09-25<br>type: video mapping | OCUBO<br>event: Imerssivus Gallery Porto</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>city: Porto<br>place: Alfândega do Porto</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>client: OCUBO<br>collaboration: David Negrão, OCUBO team</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Porto Legends Custom Media Server is an installation made in the context of OCUBO and OLAB work development.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>description EN:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The Porto Legends video mapping custom server comprises 50 video projector heads controlled by 1 master server and 5 node servers and a mapping laptop, all custom coded in TouchDesigner, running since 2018 to the date. All video projector outputs have realtime mapping grids available to fine tune, and OCUBO keeps updating the content every 3 to 6 months.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>team:<br><br>coding, concept and tech installation by Rui Gato for OLAB - installation with David Negrão, and OCUBO team.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>links:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.ocubo.com/portolegends\">https://www.ocubo.com/portolegends</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3361,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/FB_IMG_1569442199748_resultado.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3361\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":3360,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/IMG_20190921_190805_resultado.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3360\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3362,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/IMG_20190923_024424_resultado.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3362\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":3359,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/3074457345676374063_resultado.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3359\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3354,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/3074457345676374064_resultado.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3354\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3357,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/3074457345676374066_resultado.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3357\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3356,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/3074457345676374073_resultado.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3356\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3358,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/3074457345676374075_resultado.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3358\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3355,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/3074457345676374076_resultado.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3355\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3351,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/3074457345676374079_resultado.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3351\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3353,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/3074457345676374080_resultado.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3353\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":3352,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"/media/wp-content/uploads/2019/02/3074457345676374081_resultado.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-3352\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->",
